TEXT -3552 -1008 Left 6 ;Here you can step parameters to see the \ndifferent results in one plot\ni.e\n.step param psi_0 list 0 1 (for residual flux)\n.step param lf list 0 0.5 1     ; (for different load)\n.step param L list 0 3 6 9 13 ; (to regulate voltage)\n.step param skin list 0 1 ; (for skin effect testing)\n.step param kd list 0 1 ; (for kd)\n.step param netsize list 1 2 5 ;(for a bigger network)\nalong with:  \n.param cf=table(netsize,1,1,2,2,5,5)\n.param QKd=table(netsize,1,40e6,2,80e6,3,200e6)\n.param INPet=table(netsize,1,250,2,500,5,1250)\nto alter three parameters (cf and QKd and INPet) in parallel
